  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conversion from HCFC-141b in the Manufacture of PU Foam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project eliminates 11.0 ODPt (100 Mt HCFC-141b) which is essential for Morocco to fulfill its commitment under the Montreal Protocol in time. The project applies, in conformity to the MOP decision XIX/6 environmentally acceptable (non-ODS; low GWP) technology.</narrative>
  </description>
  <participating-org role="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Montreal Protocol</narrative>
  </participating-org>
